flowchart LR
  subgraph tx[Committed in the business transaction]
    led[ledger / transfer / fraud / account / customer] -->|Put outbox item PENDING| ob[(outbox table)]
  end
  ob -->|Streams INSERT, retries ≤5, bisect| pub[outbox-publisher]
  pub -->|PutEvents per-entry check| bus{{novabank events bus}}
  pub -->|failed entries| bif[batchItemFailures → retry]
  pub -->|exhausted| sf[[stream-failures SQS]]
  sched[every 5 min] --> orec[outbox-reconciliation<br/>PendingIndex query] --> bus
  orec -->|10 attempts| dead[(status FAILED_PUBLISH<br/>retained + alarm)]
  bus -->|rule| qn[[notification queue]] -->|maxReceive 5| dlqn[[DLQ]]
  bus -->|rule| qa[[audit queue]] -->|maxReceive 5| dlqa[[DLQ]]
  bus -->|undeliverable| ddlq[[delivery DLQ]]
  bus --> arch[(archive 30 d → replay)]
  qn --> n[notification λ<br/>idempotent on event_id]
  qa --> a[audit λ<br/>idempotent on event_id]
